```

simplify-cpp-comments: The shape-constants comment now carries the instantiation story that the comment above the explicit instantiations (lines 329-331) already tells [nit].

Evidence, HEAD lines 34-36:
```
// The kernel shape (PAGE_TOKENS_64, HEAD_SIZE_128, and the group sizes
// GROUP_HEADS_4 and GROUP_HEADS_16 the kernels are instantiated for at the end
