```

simplify-cpp-comments: The instantiation-list comment carries one fact in three lines [nit].

Evidence, HEAD lines 330-332:
```
// The kernel bodies live only in this translation unit, so this list is the
// set of group sizes callers can use: it equals group_heads_ok in
// amx_attn_iface.hpp.
```

Rule 3 (the one-line test). The one fact: this list must equal `group_heads_ok`, because the kernel bodies live only here. The header already states the same fact at amx_attn_iface.hpp:149-151, so the line here is a cross-reference, not the primary statement.

Reading cost: small, three lines for one fact.

Proposed text (one line, 85 columns, inside the 88-column limit of .clang-format):
